  {
    "id": 2014004010010,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、おつかれさま☆",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400401/2014004010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈こそ、お疲れ様\r\n仕事、大変だったろ？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004010020,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ぜーんぜん！　スタッフさんたち、すっごくやさしかったし\r\n甘奈、楽しかったよ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400401/2014004010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか！　終わった後、カメラマンさんから\r\n甘奈はすごく飲み込みが早いって褒められてな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "外のスタッフからも\r\nそう言ってもらえると嬉しいな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004010030,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへ、そんなに褒められると\r\nちょっとムズムズするかも",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400401/2014004010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そのご褒美ってわけじゃないが\r\n好きなのを注文してくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004010040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "え、ホント？\r\nそんな、悪いよ～",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400401/2014004010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなに気にするな\r\nほら、何が良い？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004010050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "やったー！\r\nじゃあ、どれにしよーかな～☆",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400401/2014004010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0100",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004010060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ～、どれも美味しそーだな～\r\nやっぱり甘いものが良いかな～",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400401/2014004010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0100",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004010070,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あ！　プロデューサーさん！\r\nソフトクリーム、おススメなんだって！",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400401/2014004010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かに……濃厚なバニラの香りと口触り……だとさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004010080,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そう言われると食べたくなっちゃうよね～\r\nあ！　でもこのピーチパフェもすごいかも！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400401/2014004010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004010090,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "桃１個分まるごと使用だって！　これも良いな～\r\n甜花ちゃんも好きそうだし、一緒に食べたいかも☆",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400401/2014004010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004010100,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "他にも色々あるな～！\r\nこれだけあると迷っちゃうよね☆",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400401/2014004010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004010110,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
